{"s":101,"v":[{"t":"The Striking Calamity -","w":[["ٱلْقَارِعَةُ","The Striking Calamity","al-qāriʿatu","",[["ٱلْ",2],["قَارِعَةُ",1383]]]]},{"t":"What is the Striking Calamity?","w":[["مَا","What","mā",""],["ٱلْقَارِعَةُ","(is) the Striking Calamity","l-qāriʿatu","",[["ٱلْ",2],["قَارِعَةُ",1383]]]]},{"t":"And what can make you know what is the Striking Calamity?","w":[["وَمَآ","And what","wamā","",[["وَ",1],["مَآ",12]]],["أَدْرَىٰكَ","will make you know","adrāka","",[["أَدْرَىٰ",558],["كَ",18]]],["مَا","what","mā",""],["ٱلْقَارِعَةُ","(is) the Striking Calamity","l-qāriʿatu","",[["ٱلْ",2],["قَارِعَةُ",1383]]]]},{"t":"It is the Day when people will be like moths, dispersed,","w":[["يَوْمَ","(The) Day","yawma",""],["يَكُونُ","will be","yakūnu",""],["ٱلنَّاسُ","the mankind","l-nāsu","",[["ٱل",2],["نَّاسُ",67]]],["كَٱلْفَرَاشِ","like moths","kal-farāshi","",[["كَ",54],["ٱلْ",2],["فَرَاشِ",3960]]],["ٱلْمَبْثُوثِ","scattered","l-mabthūthi","",[["ٱلْ",2],["مَبْثُوثِ",4124]]]]},{"t":"And the mountains will be like wool, fluffed up.","w":[["وَتَكُونُ","And will be","watakūnu","",[["وَ",1],["تَكُونُ",21]]],["ٱلْجِبَالُ","the mountains","l-jibālu","",[["ٱلْ",2],["جِبَالُ",313]]],["كَٱلْعِهْنِ","like wool","kal-ʿih'ni","",[["كَ",54],["ٱلْ",2],["عِهْنِ",2530]]],["ٱلْمَنفُوشِ","fluffed up","l-manfūshi","",[["ٱلْ",2],["مَنفُوشِ",4243]]]]},{"t":"Then as for one whose scales are heavy [with good deeds],","w":[["فَأَمَّا","Then as for","fa-ammā","",[["فَ",7],["أَمَّا",224]]],["مَن","(him) whose","man",""],["ثَقُلَتْ","(are) heavy","thaqulat",""],["مَوَٰزِينُهُۥ","his scales","mawāzīnuhu","",[["مَوَٰزِينُ",605],["هُۥ",5]]]]},{"t":"He will be in a pleasant life.","w":[["فَهُوَ","Then he","fahuwa","",[["فَ",7],["هُوَ",5]]],["فِى","(will be) in","fī",""],["عِيشَةٍۢ","a life","ʿīshatin",""],["رَّاضِيَةٍۢ","pleasant","rāḍiyatin",""]]},{"t":"But as for one whose scales are light,","w":[["وَأَمَّا","But as for","wa-ammā","",[["وَ",1],["أَمَّا",224]]],["مَنْ","(him) whose","man",""],["خَفَّتْ","(are) light","khaffat",""],["مَوَٰزِينُهُۥ","his scales","mawāzīnuhu","",[["مَوَٰزِينُ",605],["هُۥ",5]]]]},{"t":"His refuge will be an abyss.","w":[["فَأُمُّهُۥ","His abode","fa-ummuhu","",[["فَ",7],["أُمُّ",336],["هُۥ",5]]],["هَاوِيَةٌۭ","(will be the) Pit","hāwiyatun",""]]},{"t":"And what can make you know what that is?","w":[["وَمَآ","And what","wamā","",[["وَ",1],["مَآ",12]]],["أَدْرَىٰكَ","will make you know","adrāka","",[["أَدْرَىٰ",558],["كَ",18]]],["مَا","what","mā",""],["هِيَهْ","it is","hiyah",""]]},{"t":"It is a Fire, intensely hot.","w":[["نَارٌ","A Fire","nārun",""],["حَامِيَةٌۢ","intensely hot","ḥāmiyatun",""]]}]}